1
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,800
"Blue Lips"

2
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:13,800
(Episode 16)

3
00:01:19,599 --> 00:01:21,460
When he was eating tonight,

4
00:01:21,960 --> 00:01:23,340
he was so moved.

5
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,199
What a poor kid.

6
00:01:28,539 --> 00:01:30,499
You change your tune faster than flipping a page.

7
00:01:30,739 --> 00:01:31,980
Who was it that heard

8
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:33,800
I wanted to bring a boy home

9
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:34,800
and cried all night?

10
00:01:35,199 --> 00:01:37,099
Now you're taking his side.

11
00:01:40,460 --> 00:01:42,480
Your dad and I have thought it through.

12
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:46,099
Before, we made you go on blind dates

13
00:01:46,099 --> 00:01:47,340
and pushed you to get married.

14
00:01:48,519 --> 00:01:49,719
It was just because we thought

15
00:01:50,039 --> 00:01:51,239
after we're gone,

16
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,519
you'd be left all alone,

17
00:01:53,039 --> 00:01:54,159
lonely,

18
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:56,619
without even someone to talk to.

19
00:01:59,460 --> 00:02:00,920
Even though I still feel

20
00:02:01,099 --> 00:02:03,280
it's a bit of a pity we won't have grandchildren,

21
00:02:03,679 --> 00:02:04,320
but

22
00:02:04,699 --> 00:02:05,699
no matter what,

23
00:02:06,139 --> 00:02:07,559
at least you have a companion.

24
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:10,780
Look at Xiao Wu.

25
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:12,739
He's young and handsome,

26
00:02:13,519 --> 00:02:14,739
does well in his studies,

27
00:02:14,739 --> 00:02:16,800
is polite, and values relationships.

28
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:20,199
How did he end up falling for you?

29
00:02:21,179 --> 00:02:22,039
Ms. Hu,

30
00:02:22,179 --> 00:02:23,459
whose biological mother are you?

31
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:28,300
From now on,

32
00:02:28,519 --> 00:02:29,619
as long as the two of you

33
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,500
can live a good life together,

34
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:33,480
your dad and I

35
00:02:33,940 --> 00:02:35,579
can rest in peace.

36
00:02:36,519 --> 00:02:37,340
Don't say that.

37
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:38,460
We're all doing great.

38
00:02:38,940 --> 00:02:40,840
I have the best mom in the whole world.

39
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:43,659
You silly kid.
Get up, get up.

40
00:02:44,539 --> 00:02:45,699
Hurry up and get ready.

41
00:02:45,820 --> 00:02:46,900
He's still waiting outside.

42
00:02:54,699 --> 00:02:55,380
Xiao Lee,

43
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:56,500
what brings you here?

44
00:02:56,719 --> 00:02:57,876
My daughter is getting married.

45
00:02:57,900 --> 00:02:58,139
Here,

46
00:02:58,260 --> 00:02:59,660
I brought you some wedding candies.

47
00:02:59,719 --> 00:03:00,639
Congratulations!
Come on in.

48
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:02,440
Okay.

49
00:03:03,519 --> 00:03:04,519
Have a seat.

50
00:03:06,300 --> 00:03:07,039
This is

51
00:03:07,159 --> 00:03:08,839
Auntie Lee, who set me up on a blind date.

52
00:03:09,219 --> 00:03:10,280
You have a guest.

53
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:11,659
He's quite handsome.

54
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,280
Hello, Auntie.

55
00:03:15,579 --> 00:03:16,940
I heard Teng Mo

56
00:03:16,940 --> 00:03:18,095
brought his partner back this time.

57
00:03:18,119 --> 00:03:19,119
Is his partner not here?

58
00:03:22,739 --> 00:03:23,739
Xiao Lee,

59
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:24,800
Mo-mo's partner

60
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,159
isn't an animal in a zoo.

61
00:03:26,219 --> 00:03:27,695
You can't just gawk at him whenever you want.

62
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:28,900
Listen to you.

63
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,920
Right, speaking of partners,

64
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:33,599
Dr. Tang, who I introduced to a friend last time,

65
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,500
I heard she recently got engaged too.

66
00:03:36,019 --> 00:03:37,699
They even went abroad to do the paperwork.

67
00:03:38,239 --> 00:03:39,239
Thinking about it now,

68
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:41,380
she and Teng Mo were quite a good match.

69
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:43,639
The timing of them finding partners

70
00:03:43,780 --> 00:03:45,020
was right around the same time.

71
00:03:46,079 --> 00:03:47,940
It's a pity they didn't end up together.

72
00:03:48,980 --> 00:03:50,599
I guess it just wasn't meant to be.

73
00:03:50,719 --> 00:03:51,719
Right.

74
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:53,860
Xiao Teng,

75
00:03:54,099 --> 00:03:55,440
when are you going to introduce your partner

76
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,900
to me?

77
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:00,320
I want to see who this incredible person is

78
00:04:00,699 --> 00:04:02,139
that managed to snatch away

79
00:04:02,139 --> 00:04:03,659
such an outstanding young man of ours.

80
00:04:05,559 --> 00:04:06,559
Well,

81
00:04:09,719 --> 00:04:10,719
about that...

82
00:04:11,599 --> 00:04:12,599
Look at this.

83
00:04:12,659 --> 00:04:14,619
The ones I bought this time don't seem very good.

84
00:04:15,019 --> 00:04:16,019
What is it?

85
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:17,500
Bloodworms.

86
00:04:18,139 --> 00:04:19,139
His fish bait.

87
00:04:21,159 --> 00:04:22,320
I still have things to do.

88
00:04:22,599 --> 00:04:23,599
I'll get going now.

89
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:24,179
Alright.
Let's chat next time.

90
00:04:24,940 --> 00:04:25,400
Leaving so soon?

91
00:04:25,599 --> 00:04:26,659
Stay a bit longer.

92
00:04:28,039 --> 00:04:29,039
Take care.

93
00:04:33,619 --> 00:04:34,679
Dr. Tang?

94
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,360
Who is that?

95
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:38,719
Dr. Tang, well,

96
00:04:40,059 --> 00:04:41,099
hey, Mo-mo,

97
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:42,420
you should

98
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,420
take Xiao Wu out for a walk.

99
00:04:44,420 --> 00:04:46,400
Fengzhou has a lot of fun places.

100
00:04:46,619 --> 00:04:47,960
Go out and get something to eat and drink.

101
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:48,380
Yes, yes, yes.
Don't just stay cooped up at home.

102
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:49,559
Go on.
Let's go.

103
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,480
So, this Dr. Tang

104
00:05:05,099 --> 00:05:06,320
is kind of our matchmaker.

105
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:07,820
You could say that.

106
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:10,460
If it weren't for her,

107
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,000
maybe we would have missed each other.

108
00:05:14,239 --> 00:05:15,360
I'm really curious.

109
00:05:16,659 --> 00:05:18,159
What did she say to you?

110
00:05:20,159 --> 00:05:21,159
She said,

111
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:22,840
if she guessed correctly,

112
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:25,980
my sweetheart must be in a very difficult situation right now.

113
00:05:27,159 --> 00:05:27,920
Those words

114
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,179
were like a seed

115
00:05:29,820 --> 00:05:31,400
taking root and sprouting in my heart.

116
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:32,800
I couldn't help but imagine

117
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,360
what you were going through in Jinyang.

118
00:05:34,679 --> 00:05:36,079
Even the slightest bit of hardship,

119
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,480
I couldn't bear it.

120
00:05:39,460 --> 00:05:41,099
Now I really want to meet her.

121
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:42,920
You

122
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,940
couldn't figure it out for a whole month,

123
00:05:45,659 --> 00:05:47,699
but she understood after just a few words with you.

124
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:50,400
Yeah.

125
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:52,480
I'd also really like to meet her partner.

126
00:05:55,139 --> 00:05:56,139
You're curious?

127
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,320
We're friends.

128
00:05:58,500 --> 00:05:59,500
I just want to meet them.

129
00:06:01,320 --> 00:06:02,360
She was curious about you,

130
00:06:02,659 --> 00:06:03,659
so naturally,

131
00:06:03,739 --> 00:06:04,739
I'm curious about her.

132
00:06:06,860 --> 00:06:07,340
So,

133
00:06:07,699 --> 00:06:09,039
what did you tell her about me?

134
00:06:12,099 --> 00:06:13,099
I said

135
00:06:14,059 --> 00:06:15,320
you are a pure person

136
00:06:16,019 --> 00:06:17,800
who easily gets hurt.

137
00:06:39,619 --> 00:06:40,619
Let me tell you,

138
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,640
I had it really rough when I was in school.

139
00:06:42,699 --> 00:06:43,796
My mom was a teacher at the school,

140
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:44,820
and my homeroom teacher.

141
00:06:45,260 --> 00:06:46,356
She kept an eye on me every day.

142
00:06:46,380 --> 00:06:47,715
I couldn't hide anything from her.

143
00:06:47,739 --> 00:06:49,035
She always called on me in class.

144
00:06:49,059 --> 00:06:50,179
It was like being in prison.

145
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,900
Doesn't that mean any love letters you received

146
00:06:52,900 --> 00:06:53,900
would get confiscated?

147
00:06:55,179 --> 00:06:56,219
Exactly!

148
00:07:02,599 --> 00:07:03,959
Actually, there weren't that many.

149
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:05,900
Back when I was in school,

150
00:07:05,980 --> 00:07:06,980
I wasn't that popular.

151
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,440
No way.

152
00:07:09,739 --> 00:07:11,139
I saw your photos from back then.

153
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:12,940
You were tall and slim,
and good at basketball.

154
00:07:14,380 --> 00:07:15,380
Who wouldn't like you?

155
00:07:17,179 --> 00:07:18,739
That's all in the past.

156
00:07:21,860 --> 00:07:22,340
Come on, tell me.

157
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:24,599
How many girlfriends did you have in school?

158
00:07:25,579 --> 00:07:27,059
Don't tell me you never dated anyone.

159
00:07:29,219 --> 00:07:30,219
I can't remember clearly.

160
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:33,260
If you ask me,

161
00:07:33,780 --> 00:07:35,199
you had so many you lost count.

162
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:40,320
What?

163
00:07:40,679 --> 00:07:41,679
Are you jealous?

164
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,440
A little bit.

165
00:07:48,639 --> 00:07:50,119
They probably don't even remember me.

166
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,760
They might even be married by now.

167
00:07:53,820 --> 00:07:55,380
You still haven't answered my question.

168
00:07:57,260 --> 00:07:58,579
Just one.

169
00:08:00,340 --> 00:08:01,340
And then?

170
00:08:02,599 --> 00:08:03,320
There is no "and then."

171
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:04,659
We broke up and went to college.

172
00:08:04,659 --> 00:08:05,699
We went our separate ways.

173
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:11,320
That sounds so casual.

174
00:08:13,239 --> 00:08:15,420
I take relationships very seriously, okay?

175
00:08:27,699 --> 00:08:28,699
What are you doing?

176
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:45,600
Shixian,

177
00:08:47,779 --> 00:08:48,899
the way I feel about you

178
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:50,719
is something I've never felt before.

179
00:08:54,340 --> 00:08:55,660
It has nothing to do with gender.

180
00:08:57,039 --> 00:08:58,039
The one I love

181
00:08:59,119 --> 00:09:00,119
is simply you.

182
00:09:02,859 --> 00:09:03,859
I am completely

183
00:09:04,939 --> 00:09:06,199
devoted to you.

184
00:09:07,180 --> 00:09:08,180
You have to believe me.

185
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,560
Isn't this a bit hasty?

186
00:09:22,539 --> 00:09:24,359
I thought a proposal

187
00:09:25,279 --> 00:09:26,899
should have some sort of ceremony.

188
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,040
I'll go buy a bouquet of flowers.

189
00:09:30,140 --> 00:09:31,140
No need.

190
00:09:32,119 --> 00:09:33,239
I was just kidding with you.

191
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,600
I think

192
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,439
this one and the woven grass one

193
00:09:42,579 --> 00:09:43,579
are equally beautiful.

194
00:09:49,659 --> 00:09:50,659
Put it on me.

195
00:10:06,939 --> 00:10:07,939
Shixian.

196
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,840
I'm truly in love with you.

197
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:14,000
The very first time you came to the shop for medicine,

198
00:10:16,079 --> 00:10:17,079
I just knew.

199
00:10:22,579 --> 00:10:23,579
Are you...

200
00:10:25,619 --> 00:10:26,939
sure you won't regret this?

201
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:35,520
Missing out on you

202
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,279
is what I'd regret.

203
00:11:52,319 --> 00:11:53,319
Here.

204
00:11:54,119 --> 00:11:55,220
Your favorite ice cream.

205
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:08,619
You know what, Shixian?

206
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:12,439
When we first got together,

207
00:12:12,439 --> 00:12:13,859
you were just like ice cream.

208
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,720
Freezing cold,

209
00:12:23,100 --> 00:12:24,239
prickly all over,

210
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:26,700
and keeping everyone at a distance.

211
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:30,380
Then why did you mess with me?

212
00:12:43,439 --> 00:12:44,439
And now?

213
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:53,100
Burning hot.

214
00:13:12,279 --> 00:13:13,340
Want a bite?

215
00:14:39,739 --> 00:14:40,739
Is it sweet?

216
00:14:44,340 --> 00:14:45,340
Shixian.

217
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:48,560
Don't be like this.

218
00:15:00,300 --> 00:15:01,640
You've gotten so bad.

219
00:15:08,859 --> 00:15:10,619
I had a good teacher.

220
00:15:23,039 --> 00:15:24,039
Shixian.

221
00:15:24,739 --> 00:15:25,739
Stop messing around.

222
00:16:07,039 --> 00:16:08,039
Being so forward...

223
00:16:09,840 --> 00:16:10,840
Don't you like it?

224
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:21,739
I love it to death.

225
00:16:59,500 --> 00:17:00,500
Does it hurt?

226
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:04,100
Cut the crap.

227
00:17:18,859 --> 00:17:19,859
Teng Mo.

228
00:17:26,020 --> 00:17:27,020
Teng Mo.

229
00:17:27,239 --> 00:17:27,840
I'm here.
Teng Mo.

230
00:17:28,500 --> 00:17:29,500
I'm here.

231
00:17:45,859 --> 00:17:46,859
Sis.

232
00:17:47,699 --> 00:17:48,979
If only you could come with us

233
00:17:48,979 --> 00:17:50,119
to Fengzhou.

234
00:17:51,699 --> 00:17:53,079
They would definitely love it.

235
00:18:00,619 --> 00:18:01,619
By the way,

236
00:18:01,659 --> 00:18:02,720
you mentioned before

237
00:18:03,319 --> 00:18:04,719
that you had two things to tell me.

238
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,600
One was visiting my parents.

239
00:18:07,199 --> 00:18:08,199
What's the other?

240
00:18:13,199 --> 00:18:14,199
Come on.

241
00:18:14,300 --> 00:18:15,300
I'll take you somewhere.

242
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:28,875
With this voluntary guardianship agreement from the notary,

243
00:18:28,899 --> 00:18:30,319
if anything ever happens to me,

244
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:31,960
you can sign on my behalf.

245
00:18:34,579 --> 00:18:35,619
Don't jinx it.

246
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:39,760
Hold this.

247
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:44,500
Let's go.

248
00:19:11,020 --> 00:19:12,020
Welcome.

249
00:19:13,319 --> 00:19:14,159
Welcome.
Brother Hao.

250
00:19:15,140 --> 00:19:16,140
Business is booming.

251
00:19:16,779 --> 00:19:17,359
It's alright.

252
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:18,720
Just making a living.

253
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:19,840
Making a living?

254
00:19:20,079 --> 00:19:21,760
What I do is barely scraping by.

255
00:19:23,460 --> 00:19:23,819
What do you want to drink?

256
00:19:23,979 --> 00:19:24,979
It's on me.

257
00:19:25,079 --> 00:19:26,079
I'll have an Americano.

258
00:19:26,319 --> 00:19:27,319
And for my brother,

259
00:19:27,399 --> 00:19:28,399
a black tea.

260
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:29,500
Sure.

261
00:19:35,420 --> 00:19:36,420
This one is good too.

262
00:19:38,119 --> 00:19:39,579
This is for table nine.

263
00:19:39,699 --> 00:19:40,199
I got it.

264
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,680
You do your thing.

265
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:44,180
Here you go.

266
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:45,640
Your coffee.

267
00:19:46,260 --> 00:19:47,260
Thanks.

268
00:19:49,755 --> 00:19:50,996
Company CEO exposed

269
00:19:51,020 --> 00:19:52,800
for molesting multiple minors.

270
00:19:52,939 --> 00:19:54,459
This kind of thing happens in Jinyang?

271
00:19:55,100 --> 00:19:56,100
Let me see.

272
00:19:56,246 --> 00:19:58,095
[Multiple reports of Jinyang Company's
Qi Siming molesting underage students]

273
00:19:58,119 --> 00:19:59,119
That's disgusting.

274
00:19:59,159 --> 00:20:00,500
What a monster in human skin.

275
00:20:08,180 --> 00:20:10,159
Who's the victim that sent the letter?

276
00:20:11,340 --> 00:20:12,779
I don't know. They didn't show it.

277
00:20:18,100 --> 00:20:19,180
So that's what it's about.

278
00:20:19,500 --> 00:20:20,479
How can people like this exist?
I know, right?

279
00:20:26,943 --> 00:20:30,536
[Qi Siming charged with
accepting and giving bribes]

280
00:20:35,496 --> 00:20:37,696
[Many missed calls from last name Qi]

281
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:07,500
Something on your mind?

282
00:21:09,760 --> 00:21:10,760
No.

283
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:14,680
Liar.

284
00:21:14,800 --> 00:21:15,800
We agreed

285
00:21:16,520 --> 00:21:17,939
no secrets between us.

286
00:21:22,840 --> 00:21:23,840
Shixian.

287
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:27,979
Guan Zhenghao came to me today

288
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:31,060
and told me to be careful.

289
00:21:31,840 --> 00:21:33,920
Someone is looking into my past from five years ago.

290
00:21:35,119 --> 00:21:36,199
Gu Duoer's case?

291
00:21:37,140 --> 00:21:38,140
Yeah.

292
00:21:39,479 --> 00:21:40,759
The day your sister passed away,

293
00:21:41,659 --> 00:21:43,259
people from the Bojin Law Firm found me.

294
00:21:43,979 --> 00:21:45,739
They said they were also investigating this.

295
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:48,340
If they could find me,

296
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:52,159
it means the killer can too.

297
00:21:53,859 --> 00:21:54,939
I'm terrified.

298
00:21:55,939 --> 00:21:57,439
I don't know who to trust.

299
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:01,680
What are you afraid of?

300
00:22:03,279 --> 00:22:04,500
Before, it was my parents.

301
00:22:06,119 --> 00:22:07,180
Now, I have you.

302
00:22:09,020 --> 00:22:10,700
I'm afraid I won't be able to protect you.

303
00:22:12,579 --> 00:22:13,579
Forget it.

304
00:22:14,119 --> 00:22:15,119
I...

305
00:22:15,220 --> 00:22:16,979
I'll just pretend I never got that call.

306
00:22:19,420 --> 00:22:20,420
I know

307
00:22:21,399 --> 00:22:23,100
you've always held onto your ideals.

308
00:22:24,300 --> 00:22:25,300
And you've always

309
00:22:25,899 --> 00:22:27,059
been investigating this case.

310
00:22:28,739 --> 00:22:29,739
It's okay.

311
00:22:29,779 --> 00:22:31,119
No matter what you decide,

312
00:22:31,460 --> 00:22:32,540
I'll be right by your side.

313
00:22:34,319 --> 00:22:35,720
Remember what Uncle said?

314
00:22:37,260 --> 00:22:38,600
We will always have your back.

315
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:40,880
From now on,

316
00:22:41,119 --> 00:22:42,479
do whatever you want to do.

317
00:22:42,579 --> 00:22:43,579
Don't worry so much.

318
00:22:44,779 --> 00:22:45,380
We

319
00:22:45,779 --> 00:22:46,899
are your strong support.

320
00:22:48,939 --> 00:22:50,380
We won't be a burden to you.

321
00:22:51,100 --> 00:22:52,100
Family

322
00:22:52,939 --> 00:22:54,619
will always fight alongside you.

323
00:23:00,899 --> 00:23:01,899
I'm so lucky

324
00:23:03,340 --> 00:23:04,340
to have you all.

325
00:23:35,720 --> 00:23:36,720
Hello?

326
00:23:37,359 --> 00:23:38,359
Mr. Qi.

327
00:23:39,619 --> 00:23:40,619
I'm willing to cooperate.

328
00:23:57,880 --> 00:23:59,560
Do you think your parents will accept me?

329
00:24:02,840 --> 00:24:03,840
Didn't you see

330
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:05,640
how many times my mom served you food?

331
00:24:06,220 --> 00:24:07,700
Or how many times my dad praised you?

332
00:24:11,319 --> 00:24:12,319
It's just...

333
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:14,539
I never thought this day would come.

334
00:24:15,300 --> 00:24:16,300
What day?

335
00:24:19,159 --> 00:24:20,239
The day I'd have a family.

336
00:24:25,220 --> 00:24:26,220
Shixian.

337
00:24:28,520 --> 00:24:29,520
From now on,

338
00:24:30,500 --> 00:24:32,020
my parents are your parents.

339
00:24:32,699 --> 00:24:33,699
My home

340
00:24:34,260 --> 00:24:35,260
is your home.
